
Generating datasets for testing:

1) sorted datasets
2) frequencies of datatset elements
3) mappings based on frequencies
4) datasets mapped on the basis of element frequencies
5) sorted mapped datasets
6) testset from a dataset
7) sorted testsets

1) $ ./sort-dataset.pl < dataset > dataset.sorted 
2) $ ./symb-freq.pl < dataset | sort -n -r -k2 > dataset.freq
3) $ ./gen-map-onfreq.pl < dataset.freq > dataset.freq.map
4) $ ./map-onfreq-dataset.pl dataset.freq.map < dataset > dataset.mapd
5) $ ./sort-dataset.pl < dataset.mapd > dataset.mapd.sorted 
6) $ ./gen-testset.pl percent < dataset.mapd > dataset.mapd.test
7) $ ./sort-dataset.pl < dataset.mapd.test > dataset.mapd.test.sorted 

experiments with set2 use dataset.mapd.sorted and dataset.mapd.test.sorted,
